# This repo tracks only the config and templates we mean to publish.
# Everything below is a defensive backstop so secrets, local state, or a
# user's own filled-in persona never slip in by accident.

.DS_Store
*.log
*.bak
*.pre-claude-config.*
*.pre-copilot-config.*

# Wizard output: create-persona writes the user's own persona here.
# These are personal and must never be committed to a fork of this repo.
persona/persona.md
persona/CLAUDE.md
claude-code/.claude/CLAUDE.md
claude-code/.claude/persona.md
claude-code/.claude/settings.json

# Never track machine-local overrides or credentials, even if copied in by mistake.
**/settings.local.json
**/.credentials.json
**/credentials*
**/token*
**/auth*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Session state / transcripts / caches must never be committed.
**/projects/
**/sessions/
**/history.jsonl
**/logs/
**/cache/
**/.cache/
**/telemetry/
**/shell-snapshots/
**/memory/
